The '''T-series X-wing line''' was a family of versatile [[starfighter]]s manufactured by [[Incom Corporation]]. Inspired by the [[Aggressive ReConnaissance-170 starfighter|ARC-170 fighter]] and the [[Z-95 Headhunter]], the T-series proved incredibly successful, with several models playing a key role in the [[fleet]]s of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]], the [[New Republic]], and the [[Resistance]].<ref name="Complete Vehicles 2018" />

